From c9e29120774a98d14691f24f5d111e1e46e9df37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cerXXXX <polyakovia2009@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 11:15:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] perf: don't load scene layers that stay hidden, let users
 hide layers and effects

Properties are applied once at startup, so a layer hidden by one (another
language, another clock layout) or by the author, with no script that could
show it again, is now left out of the scene with everything inside it. The
multi-language scene 3299228616 drops 253 of its 271 objects and reaches its
first frame in ~1.0 s instead of ~3.2 s.

New options:
  --list-layers           print the scene's layers and effects as JSON
  --hide-layer ID[,ID]    hide a layer and its children (not loaded)
  --disable-effect ID[,ID] turn off a layer effect

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
